---
Make synth editor scrollable. (Partially done)

FM and wavetable synth modes have many parameters that may not fit
in the panel. Add vertical scrolling.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Synth editor panel scrolls vertically when content exceeds height
- [ ] All parameters accessible via scrolling
- [ ] Scroll position resets when switching synth modes
- [ ] No layout glitches during scroll

## Test Plan
- [ ] Select FM mode, verify all 4 operator controls accessible via scroll
- [ ] Select WT mode, verify all controls accessible
- [ ] Resize window smaller, verify scroll still works
